<title>UK: AON publishes rankings of German insurance brokers.</title>
<headline>AON publishes rankings of German insurance brokers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. insurance giant Aon released a table on Wednesday ranking the top insurance brokers in Germany based on 1995 figures.</p>
<p>				Staff   Commission and fee turnover</p>
<p>					   (in million DM)</p>
<p>    1. Jauch &amp; Huebener 1,400	  310</p>
<p>    2. Gradmann Holler*   800	  210</p>
<p>    3. Aon Deutschland    450	   85</p>
<p>    4. Jaspers		410	   85</p>
<p>    5. Funk		   400	   80</p>
<p>    6. Wuppesahl	    260	   47</p>
<p>    7. Sedgwick	     150	   25</p>
<p>* Gradmann Holler is part of the Marsh &amp; McLennan Group</p>
<p>--Reuters Insurance News +44 171 542 2770</p>
</text>
